{"title":"2015 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/e/4bedcc8a02ed095ac9d4ff85daddf72dade01025.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2 \\times 3 + 4}{2 + 3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"78\" height=\"40\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/b/63bab8e5cbae7a527be2549c0768e9fb118b40b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 2 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 5 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 8 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 4 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"360\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Following <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Order_of_operations\" title=\"Order of operations\">order of operations</a>, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/2/9b2646f5e492102639e53b01027092f8c35b68d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2 \\times 3 + 4}{2 + 3} = \\frac{6 + 4}{2 + 3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"146\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/9/0794e6c8efbf4d3a39349e2aac40d500840ea7a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{10}{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"43\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/8/778d2809623ed88f987175dd486e1ca4d138156a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed {\\textbf {(A) } 2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"77\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Fermat\" title=\"2015 CEMC Fermat\">2015 CEMC Fermat</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Fermat_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CEMC Fermat Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Fermat_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CEMC Fermat Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2015 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2015 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Fermat_Prob